<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ upgrades AMR to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ upgrades AMR to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette said it upgraded AMR Corp to buy from market perform, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 1/8 to 82 in morning trade.</p>
</text>
